sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Completed Promotion
    participant E as Evaluator
    participant S as Simulator Capability
    participant X as xmemory
    participant L as Learner

    O->>E: scenario + chosen discount + chosen outcome

    E->>S: replay 0%
    S-->>E: profit_0
    E->>S: replay 10%
    S-->>E: profit_10
    E->>S: replay 20%
    S-->>E: profit_20
    E->>S: replay 30%
    S-->>E: profit_30

    Note over E: find best discount<br/>calculate regret

    E->>X: save PromotionCase

    E->>L: case + 2 lesson keys
    L->>X: read linked cases for SKU Lesson
    X-->>L: evidence
    L->>X: update SKU Lesson

    L->>X: read linked cases for category Lesson
    X-->>L: evidence
    L->>X: update category Lesson

    Note over E,L: one experience is now reusable memory
